    {"id":"te516869886637","type":"text","x":4172.92,"y":243.8,"width":46.56,"height":12.5,"strokeColor":"#ffffff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":0,"groupIds":["addrnamed"],"text":"changed","fontSize":10,"fontFamily":9,"lineHeight":1.25,"index":"bIM"},
    {"id":"te741356518881","type":"text","x":4020,"y":661.54,"width":191.47,"height":16.25,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":0,"groupIds":["addrnamed"],"text":"11.  Connected on purchase","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":9,"lineHeight":1.25,"index":"bIN"},
    {"id":"te1034797212943","type":"text","x":4020,"y":678.18,"width":250.27,"height":41.25,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":0,"groupIds":["addrnamed"],"text":"Alice's address shows the name with no Set\nSimpleX name step. Import keeps that step for\nnames registered elsewhere.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":9,"lineHeight":1.25,"index":"bIO"},
    {"id":"te428944192737","type":"text","x":60,"y":3183.98,"width":4112.66,"height":41.25,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":0,"text":"Design document, not screenshots: screens are drawn in the app's iOS idiom, and alerts as the apps draw them. Tags compare with phase 2 (simplex-names-flow-phase2.svg): as phase 2, changed, new. Store builds pay in the app store for a fixed 2-year term; desktop and F-Droid builds register with a code from store.simplex.chat; a code works on every build. One choice per screen: a button confirms it, and at most one other way sits under the button, as the app's own screens do. The name is searched first, on the screen where it is typed, and only a search sends it; only its length is judged as it is typed. A name points at the address or channel it was started from, with no picker, and X on that row registers it leading nowhere. A code\nbought on the web comes back in the link that reopens the app, with the chosen name still there: the store is given the name's length, never the name. Terms and the recovery key come once, right before the first payment or redemption. Register via search and find via registration connect this canvas to the lookup canvas: its Available alert (2c) and an expired own name (4d) open 3 already searched, and a search shows what uses a taken name, one tap from opening or connecting it. A registered name points at the chosen contact address and channel, and each claims it at once. Import, entering a recovery key, name scanning, the recovery key screens and the reminder after the first name are on the backup canvas.\nNot redrawn, and unchanged from phase 2: a name managed elsewhere, and Technical details. Not in phase 3a: owning a name (the hub with names, changing where a name points, renewing), transfers, subnames, and expiry reminders by message.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":9,"lineHeight":1.25,"index":"bIR"},
    {"id":"te737560611778","type":"text","x":882.8,"y":413.2,"width":94.39,"height":14,"strokeColor":"#007aff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":0,"text":"Register a name","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":9,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"ar715639850341","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"bIU"},
